sequenceDiagram
    %% AgentUML: Single-Agent ReAct Loop
    %% Pattern: Observe → Reason → Act → Observe (loop until goal met)
    %% Context-Window Risk: LOW — single context window, bounded observations

    participant U as User
    participant A as ReAct Agent <<agent>>
    participant M as Working Memory <<memory_working>>
    participant W as Web Search <<tool>>
    participant LLM as Gemini LLM <<llm>>

    U->>A: 1. Submit goal
    A->>M: 2. Load scratchpad
    A->>LLM: 3. Reason: what tool to call?

    loop Observation Loop (until goal satisfied)
        LLM-->>A: 4. Select action + args
        A->>W: 5. Execute tool [deterministic]
        W-->>A: 6. Return observation
        A->>M: 7. Append observation to context
        A->>LLM: 8. Re-reason with updated context
    end

    LLM-->>A: 9. Goal met — generate final answer
    A-->>U: 10. Final Response
